on management, Paycom learning, certification management. The company also offers time and labor management, such as time and attendance, scheduling, time-off requests, and labor allocation solutions. Its HCM solution provides manager on-the-go that gives supervisors and managers the ability to perform a variety of tasks, such as approving time-off requests and expense reimbursements; direct data exchange; ask here, a tool for direct line of communication to ask work-related questions; document and checklist; government and compliance; benefits administration; COBRA administration; personnel action and performance discussion forms; Paycom surveys; retirement reporting; report center; and affordable care act applications, as well as Clue, which securely collects, tracks, and manages the vaccination and testing data of the workforce; and MyCom is a communications tool that provides organizations with a central place to share information with employees. Paycom Software, Inc. was founded in 1998 and is based in Oklahoma City, Oklahoma.","employees":5770,"website":"https://www.paycom.com","country":"United States","city":"Oklahoma City","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Chad R. Richison","title":"Founder, CEO & Chairman of the Board"},{"name":"Mr. Terrell  Hadlock","title":"President & Chief Client Officer"},{"name":"Mr. Robert D. Foster","title":"Chief Financial Officer"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":17.23,"tpe":29.42,"ps":4.345,"pfcf":25.83,"peg":1.1,"pb":4.645,"ev_ebitda":18.74,"rev_growth":0.1935,"eps_growth":0.377,"eps_growth_fwd":0.2545,"eps_growth_next":0.1771,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.1242,"roa":0.05009,"de":32.04,"gross_margin":0.5374,"op_margin":0.1175,"profit_margin":0.09496,"current_ratio":1.852},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":16.45,"sector":17.23,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":23.79,"sector":29.42,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":5.115,"sector":4.345,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pfcf","label